<item><title>Court rejects State bid to block Mundubile and Zulu bail hearing</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/court-rejects-state-bid-to-block-mundubile-and-zulu-bail-3108ec/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/court-rejects-state-bid-to-block-mundubile-and-zulu-bail-3108ec/</guid><category>Zambia</category><description>The Lusaka High Court ruled the bail application of opposition leaders Brian Mundubile and Makebi Zulu and 16 others must now be heard on its merits.</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:37:06 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/court-rejects-state-bid-to-block-mundubile-and-zulu-bail-3108ec/share.jpg" length="41936" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/zm/court-rejects-state-bid-to-block-mundubile-and-zulu-bail-3108ec/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
